ReasoningForge (推理工坊)

This project adapts the transparent GRPO training flow from MiniMind:
https://github.com/jingyaogong/minimind

Local source snapshot at project creation:
  repository: ../minimind
  git HEAD: 6fc918beb68a0d8c40452338df6319fe168014ba
  source files: trainer/train_grpo.py, trainer/rollout_engine.py,
                trainer/trainer_utils.py, dataset/lm_dataset.py
  The local checkout included uncommitted user learning annotations/changes.

MiniMind is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The original license text is retained in LICENSE.

ReasoningForge changes: independent Hugging Face model adapter, PEFT LoRA,
explicit padding/EOS/position alignment, isolated objective functions,
rule-based verification, microbatch normalization, rollout reuse, checkpoints,
offline tests, evaluation, and Chinese educational documentation.
